{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Meets Sandra"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Getting Along Well"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le07ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Agreeing and Disagreeing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use different phrases to agree and disagree tactfully (politely)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "At the workplace, we ask for others' opinion with questions such as:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> <li>What do you think?</li> <li>I'm interested in your feedback/input.</li> <li>Please let me know your thoughts.</li> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We show agreement or disagreement with statements in the chart below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Agreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disagreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I agree with you 100 percent.</br> I couldn't agree with you more.</br> That's so true.</br> You're absolutely right.</br> Absolutely.</br> That's exactly how I feel.</br> Exactly.</br> You have a point there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't think so.</br> I'm afraid I disagree.</br> I beg to differ.</br> Not necessarily.</br> That's not always true.</br> I'm not sure if ...</br> I see what you're saying, but ...</br> I don't know about that ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else will happen."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you cook the meat too long,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it will burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you will cook the meat too long. In this condition: it will burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I ask the teacher to help me,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible I will ask the teacher to help me. In this condition: I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If he gets a high-paying job,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he can go on a vacation twice a year.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible he will get a high-paying job. In this condition: he can go on vacation twice a year.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to miss someone"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel that you want to be with someone but you can't"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: John misses Sally after not talking to her for a long time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Guess what?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "You say this before 